ady live and the full game comes out on 4th November, so it is only 2 weeks from now! If you played before, welcome back!ImprovementsYou can now change how your gear looks like if you buy the wardrobe!The demo now has a native Linux version, as a few of you asked for it. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:38:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694475","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091900-1846018067927788","game_id":"steam-5091900","kind":"update","title":"Update 8: 0.9.4.8 - Counter builds, Scratch Cards, new side panel and more fixes","summary":"Hi everyone! Update 8 has a lot of content again. The full game gets better counter builds, new build picks, Scratch Cards and a lot of small fixes and balance changes, as well as over 50 new achievements! The demo gets clearer goals, pins and more QoL you wished for :) Also as you hopefully can see, I have an all new Steam capsule, I hope you like it!Counter buildsCounters are a real build now.A new Counter Damage stat, that makes this buildstyle more viable in the mid to late game.Four new cou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T23:22:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927788","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091900-1844751498219663","game_id":"steam-5091900","kind":"update","title":"Update 7: Companion Falls for You & v0.9.3.7 New animations and QoL improvements","summary":"Hi everyone! Two things today: Prigod Idle is part of the Steam event Companion Falls for You and there is a big update for you. I have been working day and night on this one :)Companion Falls for YouThis is a Steam event for desktop companion games. It is hosted by Mister Morris Games, the developer of Rusty's Retirement, together with IndieLab. It starts today and I am very happy to be part of it! Have a look at the other games too: Link Prigod Idle runs well in a small window at the side of y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T22:01:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219663","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091900-1843481262700392","game_id":"steam-5091900","kind":"update","title":"Update 6: New animations, UI improvements + crash fix","summary":"Just a small patch this time, mostly about how the game looks and feels. A lot of them were on the beta branch for a few weeks, now I feel somewhat confident to release it. What's newA lot of new animations, especially for abilities in combat. Some are still placeholders, but I am getting closer to the final version.Improved UI while fighting. I hope this is more readable, leave feedback!A lot of small UI updates and improvements, for example on the achievements screen and the reward screen. Aft","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T00:05:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700392","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091900-1843481262690191","game_id":"steam-5091900","kind":"update","title":"Update 5: 0.9.1.1 - A new look across the game + all new damage chart","summary":"A lot of things have been fixed since Update 4, I have been working day and night! Most of it is art plus fixes from your reports, thanks again for your engagement! There is also the one thing people kept asking for: a damage panel that tells you where your damage actually went, as well as several UI improvements. As some people also did not know: you can switch profiles in the (new improved) setting menu, try it out if you like to start another playthrough :)The new damage chartFour looks to pi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T19:11:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690191","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091900-1842846814451588","game_id":"steam-5091900","kind":"update","title":"Update 4: Twice the monsters, a Prologue, more abilities and a hero+pet","summary":"Thank you for all the feedback since Update 3. Wow, nearly 30% of you have played the demo for more than two hours already. That is more than I hoped for. Since then I have worked through over 25 rounds of tester reports, and I am deep in the translations. The German pass alone is close to 9000 strings and I read every one of them myself. Most of what follows is in the demo. The full game parts are at the end. Twice the monsters Every stage now draws from six regular foes and two elites. It was ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T20:04:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451588","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091900-1842212951307667","game_id":"steam-5091900","kind":"update","title":"Update 3 - Full idle mode, tech trees reworked and a release date","summary":"Development is going on nicely, thank you for all your feedback. This is a bigger post than the last two. Auto-run turns Prigod Idle into a full idle game, every tech tree is drawn as an actual tree, six screens were rebuilt, the loading times got reduced massively and there is a long list of fixes and balance changes from your reports.While some of these changes will only effect the full game later, most of these changes are already available for you in the demo!And also: We have a release date","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T14:28:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951307667","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091900-1842212951295369","game_id":"steam-5091900","kind":"announcement","title":"Prigod Idle 0.9.0.182 - playtest fixes, bosses with abilities, better merging","summary":"Thanks for the reports from the first week. This update is mostly fixes you asked for and a few more quality of life features.Fixed- A fresh save could stop reacting to clicks after the very first tutorial- Docked side panels and your window size were being forgotten whenever an audio slider moved. They now stick and a game closed maximized opens maximized.- Side panels no longer close on their own after a fight.- The hero no longer flashes \"naked\" for a moment when a fight fades out.- Scaled bo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T00:34:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951295369","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091900-1841579228674202","game_id":"steam-5091900","kind":"announcement","title":"First batch of bug fixes and changes","summary":"Patch 0.9.0.164Hello,these are the first patch notes since the demo launched, thank you guys for all the feedback!You can now scale every text and tooltip in the game. Settings -> Audio and Display. Four steps for now: 92%, 100%, 112% and 125%.This came from demo feedback. Several of you said the game was hard to read on a bigscreen. It will be the first of a few following types of fixes to improve readability.Buttons do not respondSome players finished the intro and were stuck after the tutoria","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T23:10:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228674202","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5091900-1841579228671487","game_id":"steam-5091900","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo is out now!","summary":"Hi! I am Nicolas, the solo developer behind Prigod Idle. As of today you can download the free demo directly from the store page. What is in the demo- The first ten stages of the campaign, roughly 2-3 hours of play- The full core loop: your hero fights automatically, and every win is set up by your decisions. Gear, abilities, upgrades and idle generators with offline progress- The real start of the game. Everything beyond you can't unlock now will be in the final version, releasing soon! Be read","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T14:14:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671487","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5091900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5091900":"2026-10-26T08:20:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5091900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:01Z"},"5091970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_check